### generate_tui_html_page sink (app.ui.tui_web.html:75 innerHTML payload source)

#### keeps a malicious cell as inert escaped text in the full page, not live markup

- Verify: keeps a malicious cell as inert escaped text in the full page, not live markup


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 6 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: keeps a malicious cell as inert escaped text in the full page, not live markup")
val tui_html = screen_to_html("<script>alert(1)</script>")
val page = generate_tui_html_page(tui_html, 8080)
expect(page).to_contain("&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;")
assert_false(page.contains("<script>alert(1)</script>"))
```

</details>

#### keeps an apostrophe-bearing cell escaped in the full page

- Verify: keeps an apostrophe-bearing cell escaped in the full page


